            <title>[IGNITE-12630] Remove developers sections from parent pom.xml</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12630</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We have a &amp;lt;developers&amp;gt; section in parent/pom.xml. Listed info in fact is outdated and it is not practical and useful to enumerate everyone in this section. Moreover the proper position here is that the project is developed by Apache Ignite Community.&lt;/p&gt;

